cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code, please cite the article it accompanies.
title: >-
  Simulation code for "Uncover This Tech Term: Model Calibration"
abstract: >-
  Code reproducing every number, the figure and the table in a short primer on
  calibration of clinical prediction models, published in the Korean Journal of
  Radiology. The worked example uses risk models that differ only by a
  rank-preserving transformation, so that discrimination is held exactly
  constant while calibration is varied.
type: software
